# Strata: Hierarchical Context Caching for Long Context Language Model Serving

Zhiqiang Xie Stanford University & NVIDIA xiezhq@stanford.edu

Yuwei An Carnegie Mellon University ayw.sirius19@gmail.com

Ziyi Xu Shanghai Jiao Tong University xzy2022@sjtu.edu.cn

Vikram Sharma Mailthody NVIDIA vmailthody@nvidia.com

